  </subsection>
 <subsection title="SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions">
  <para unique="1261717">
   <string>Invalid if SNaN operand and invalid if QNaN and predicate as listed in </string><link linkend="15627: 06_Table: Table 5-1. Comparison Predicate for CMPPD and CMPPS Instructions (Contd.)"><string>Table&#160;3&#8209;8</string></link><string>, Denormal.</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1261723" format="xIndent1">
   <string>VEX-encoded instructions, see </string><link linkend="73761: 06_Table: Table 2-19. Type 2 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;19, &#8220;Type 2 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  <para unique="1261727" format="xIndent1">
   <string>EVEX-encoded instructions, see </string><link linkend="35185: 06_Table: Table 2-46. Type E2 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;48, &#8220;Type E2 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
